2
00:00:01.644 --> 00:00:30.137
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Choose the operation. Pehle sawaal mein dekho ki cheezein jud rahi hain, baanti ja rahi hain, ya compare ho rahi hain. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
